  "remarks": "JSC “Lavochkin Research and Production Association” was founded by state corporation for space activities “Roscosmos” and carries out work on the design, manufacture, testing and comprehensive development of automatic spacecraft. It also maintains weapons and military equipment. JSC “Lavochkin Research and Production Association” works with the Ministry of Defence to create a satellite remote sensing system to improve the effectiveness of military troops. The company’s parent satellites are part of the Russia’s military space surveillance network. Therefore, JSC “Lavochkin Research and Production Association” is materially supporting the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine. In addition, JSC “Lavochkin Research and Production Association” is supporting Russia’s military and industrial complex, including by being involved in the development of military technology and equipment.",
